      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Secret Management**\n\nOkay, I'm thinking about how to build this `fetch_db_secret.py` file. I'm leaning toward using Google Cloud Secret Manager for the secrets. The next step is to write out the code that will interface with the API. I'll need to figure out how to retrieve the secret and then securely inject it into the database connection process.\n\n\n**Defining Secret Implementation**\n\nI've decided on Google Cloud Secret Manager. Now, I'm working on the code for `fetch_db_secret.py`, focusing on how to integrate the Google Cloud Secret Manager client library. I'm aiming to create a robust and secure method for secret retrieval, considering elements like `google.cloud.secretmanager` import and utilizing `SecretManagerServiceClient`.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819958340,
          "start": 1789819956423
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9952cc6001KuCADJ7LSKqSL7",
